---
# XmegaTimer's code from before the template, until a later version rewrites it in the namespace
# xmega_timer (OIL 3): its names, macros, typedefs and C enums are what these groups report.
# They come on with that version, each with what it finds fixed, and this file goes then. The
# tests and the mock are new and keep every check.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-assignment-in-if-condition,
  -bugprone-signed-bitwise,
  -cppcoreguidelines-*,
  -google-*,
  -misc-*,
  -modernize-*,
  -performance-enum-size,
  -readability-*
